ex:Metric_Obj10_Balloons a backlog:Metric ; rdfs:label "Code slides on the chapter 10 and 11 decks with a story balloon and two result balloons: 0 -> 37"@en ; backlog:metricUnit "slide" ; backlog:metricBaseline 0 ; backlog:metricTarget 37 .
ex:Obs0_Obj10_Balloons a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj10_Balloons ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-19T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Baseline: the builder 2.5.0 and both decks have no balloons (the deck standard reports 19 code slides in chapter 11 and 18 in chapter 10)."@en .
